@SmartNotesApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5013

GET {{SmartNotesApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Get all notes (Ordered by CreatedAt descending)
GET {{SmartNotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/notes
Accept: application/json


### 2. Save a new note
POST {{SmartNotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "id": 0,
  "title": "Review EF Core Migration",
  "content": "Praveen needs to review the EF Core migration script by Thursday. LocalDB connections must be tested before release.",
  "summary": "- [ ] Review EF Core migration script (Praveen, by Thursday)\n- [ ] Test LocalDB connections prior to release"
}

### 3. Test AI Multi-Mode Processing (Summarize / Action Items / Q&A)
POST {{SmartNotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/ai/process
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "content": "Meeting today: Fix bug #102 by Friday.",
  "mode": "action_items"
}


### 4. Delete a note by ID (Replace 1 with an existing note ID)
DELETE {{SmartNotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/notes/19

